---
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import { pokeBattle } from '../../../data/pokeBattle';
import { origin } from '../../../data/site';
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { canonicalUrl } from '../../../lib/seo';
import '../../../styles/product.css';
---
<Layout title="Poke Battle — Privacy Policy" description="How Poke Battle handles offline gameplay, Creem purchases, Zepp OS licence activation, website visits and support." canonical={canonicalUrl('/pokebattle/privacy')} ogImage={`${origin}/pokebattle/icon.png`} ogImageWidth="500" ogImageHeight="500" preloadHero={false}>
  <Header slot="header" />
  <article class="product legal">
    <h1>Poke Battle — Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Effective <time datetime={pokeBattle.effectiveDate}>{pokeBattle.effectiveLabel}</time></p>
    <section><h2>Summary</h2><p>Poke Battle for Garmin, Poke Battle for Zepp OS and Random PokeBattle for Apple Watch play offline. The apps do not transmit battle history, Pokédex progress or settings to me, and contain no advertising or analytics. Buying the Zepp OS full activation through Creem and activating it with a licence key, visiting this website or contacting support involves separate data processing described below.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Who is responsible</h2><p>Aníbal Ribeiro, Prague, Czech Republic, is responsible for the personal data he processes for this product, website and support. Contact: <a href="mailto:email@anibalribeiro.cz">email@anibalribeiro.cz</a>.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Data on your watch</h2><p>Battle history, win/loss records, Pokédex progress and options are saved locally. The apps do not require an account or send gameplay, health or location data to a developer server. The Zepp OS version also counts the day’s free battles and caches its activation status on the watch. Use Options to reset battle history; uninstall the app to remove its local data. Platform backup and restore features are governed by Garmin, Zepp or Apple. RESET HISTORY is not a request to erase payment or support records.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Purchases through Creem</h2><p>The Zepp OS full activation is sold through <a href="https://www.creem.io/">Creem</a>. Creem acts as merchant of record and handles checkout, payment details, receipts and taxes under its <a href="https://www.creem.io/privacy">Privacy Notice</a> and <a href="https://www.creem.io/buyer-terms">Buyer Terms</a>. I may receive your email address, order reference, purchased product, payment status and billing information needed to deliver the purchase, provide support, handle refunds and keep accounting records. I do not receive your full card details.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Zepp OS licence activation</h2><p>To check a Zepp OS licence, the Poke Battle settings in the Zepp app on your phone contact my licence service. It stores your licence key, your purchase email (to confirm that a request to move the licence to another watch comes from the buyer), the Creem order, customer and licence identifiers (to recognise the purchase and handle refunds or disputes), and a random activation id created by the app on your watch. The activation id only tells which install a licence is active on; it is not a device identifier and says nothing else about your watch. The app does not read or store a device identifier. These records are kept while the licence exists and afterwards as long as needed for refunds, disputes and accounting.</p><p>To limit abuse, the service keeps a keyed hash of your IP address and of the activation id for no more than one hour, and a keyed hash of a licence key for 24 hours to limit moves between watches. The IP address itself is never stored. Creem payment event ids are kept for 90 days to ignore repeated deliveries. Nothing is used for advertising or tracking.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Website and support</h2><p>These product pages set no cookies and include no analytics or advertising scripts. The hosting provider may process ordinary request logs, including IP address, requested page, browser information and time, for security and operation. If you email me, I process your email address, message and any order or device information you choose to include to answer your request.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Purposes, legal bases and retention</h2><p>Purchase fulfilment, licence activation and requested support are processed to perform a contract or take steps you request before a purchase. Security, abuse prevention and resolving support issues rely on legitimate interests. Required financial records are retained to comply with legal obligations. Support correspondence is kept while needed to resolve the enquiry and related disputes; purchase records are kept for fulfilment and applicable accounting obligations. Gameplay stays on your device until you remove it.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Recipients and international processing</h2><p>Data may be handled by Creem, Cloudflare (which hosts the licence service), website hosting and email providers as needed for purchases, licence activation, website operation and support, and by authorities where legally required. I do not sell your data. Providers may process data outside the European Economic Area; where required, transfers must use an applicable adequacy decision or other lawful safeguards. Creem explains its processing and transfer safeguards in its privacy notice. Apple, Garmin and Zepp Health handle their own stores, backups and platform services under their own policies.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Your rights</h2><p>Where applicable, you can request access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability of personal data, or object to processing based on legitimate interests. Email <a href="mailto:email@anibalribeiro.cz">email@anibalribeiro.cz</a> with enough information to identify the relevant order or correspondence. Some records must be retained by law. I cannot retrieve gameplay stored only on your watch. You may complain to your local data protection authority or the Czech <a href="https://uoou.gov.cz/">Office for Personal Data Protection</a>.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Children</h2><p>The apps do not collect personal data from players, including children; Zepp OS licence data relates only to the buyer. Purchases must be made by someone legally able to enter the purchase contract or with appropriate parental permission. If you believe a child supplied personal data through support, contact me.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Changes</h2><p>Updates to this policy will appear on this page with a revised effective date.</p></section>
  </article>
  <nav class="product-links" aria-label="Poke Battle links">
    <a href="/pokebattle/">About Poke Battle</a>
    <a href="/pokebattle/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/pokebattle/terms/">Terms</a>
    <a href="/pokebattle/support/">Support</a>
  </nav>
  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
<style>.product-links { flex-wrap: wrap; }</style>
